flowchart TD
    User((User))
    UploadForm[File Upload Form]
    UploadAPI[Upload Service]
    VirusScanner[Virus Scanner Service]
    StorageBucket[(Object Storage)]
    NotifyService[Notification Service]

    User -->|selects file and submits| UploadForm
    UploadForm -->|send file| UploadAPI
    UploadAPI -->|scan for malware| VirusScanner
    VirusScanner -->|scan passed| UploadAPI
    UploadAPI -->|store file| StorageBucket
    UploadAPI -->|send upload complete notice| NotifyService
